/// One row per capital project: 1,846 projects, 1,846 identifiers. The key is the corrected
/// business key CP-{entity}-{period}-{asset_class}-{seq} (ADR-0026) and no surrogate is
/// introduced to stand in for it -- a surrogate here would hide the very thing the correction
/// fixed. Asset class is an attribute, not a separate dimension.
table 'Capital Project'
	lineageTag: d600e6d8-a781-5140-b961-483335a08667

	column project_id
		dataType: string
		isKey
